{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 10, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "pit g h: polynomial identity testing (Schwartz-Zippel), seed 7\n  g has total degree at most 2, h at most 2\n  polynomials of total degree at most 2, equal at 16 random points mod 2^61 - 1: two that differ agree at one with probability at most 2/(2^61 - 1) = 8.67e-19 (Schwartz-Zippel), at all 16 with at most 1.03e-289\n  -> equal as polynomials over the integers, except with probability at most 1.03e-289 (not a proof: a probabilistic answer)\n     in u8 they are then equal for every input: reduction mod 2^8 is a ring homomorphism\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 10, "ok": true, "cmd": "pit", "ucas": "pit g h trials 16 seed 7", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "pit", "seed": 7, "trials": 16, "degree": 2, "verdict": "equal_probably", "error_probability": 1.0261342003245941e-289}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "probabilistic", "text": "polynomials of total degree at most 2, equal at 16 random points mod 2^61 - 1: two that differ agree at one with probability at most 2/(2^61 - 1) = 8.67e-19 (Schwartz-Zippel), at all 16 with at most 1.03e-289"}, "files": [], "text": "pit g h: polynomial identity testing (Schwartz-Zippel), seed 7\n  g has total degree at most 2, h at most 2\n  polynomials of total degree at most 2, equal at 16 random points mod 2^61 - 1: two that differ agree at one with probability at most 2/(2^61 - 1) = 8.67e-19 (Schwartz-Zippel), at all 16 with at most 1.03e-289\n  -> equal as polynomials over the integers, except with probability at most 1.03e-289 (not a proof: a probabilistic answer)\n     in u8 they are then equal for every input: reduction mod 2^8 is a ring homomorphism\n"}, "isError": false}}
